    "description": "WT_Market carries combined values that break routing: 'MI/NJ-USA' and 'United States & Canada'. State is also not required where it should be.\n\nRelated migration items:\n\n* C7 state coverage per deal — four programs split cleanly per state while multi-state books were kept as one national deal. BETMGM-CTM and DraftKings-C show two distinct coverage groups, which may mean they are two separate deals. Needs the authoritative list of active partner-and-book combinations by state to know how many Deal records to create\n\n* C8 Alberta — eight programs and 191 assignments reference Alberta but the market picklist has no Alberta value. Either add it, or those deals rely on country + state alone\n\n* Retire the combined values\n\n* Make state required where the country requires it (feeds BUILD-86 readiness criterion 4)\n\n* Confirm the Alberta decision\n\n* Reconcile against WagerTech's authoritative state list\n\nEffort: \\~3h. Needs the client's state list to finish.\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §5; CMS Integration Design v1 §9 items C7-C8.",
